        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-TK-CLOSURE.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-TK-CLOSURE-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH286-GRAND-TK-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH287-TIMING-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH288-COHESION-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH289-SAAT-INVARIANT-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH290-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-FPGA-TK-CLOSURE-WIT      PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-TK-CLOSURE.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-TK-CLOSURE.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH286-GRAND-TK-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH287-TIMING-CLOSURE-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH288-COHESION-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH289-SAAT-INVARIANT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH290-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-FPGA-TK-CLOSURE-WIT
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-FPGA-TK-CLOSURE-WIT.
